+The earlier AAL11/UAL175field mismatch remains unchanged in its [preserved report](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/0584407dac2190a9f9514ee157124446e60672d5/investigation/broader-evidence/faa-tmu1078-source-2026-10-30/README.md). AWA940's subject/work-file aircraft labels agree; this is contrary evidence against treating every file as having that mismatch. It does not correct AWA937or select its right aircraft. The different case, date, role and work-file fields have different asserted purposes; none is silently normalized into another. Shared layout or production features can be source dependence, not multiple independent historical observations. Native versions and the actual assembly/page/case crosswalk are missing.
